{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Commands.ActionGroupCommandModel, MixItUp.Base","RunOneRandomly":false,"ID":"520670f0-2345-4afd-8db9-1cce83f6089a","Name":"Elgato MCP Controller","Type":4,"IsEnabled":true,"Unlocked":false,"IsEmbedded":false,"GroupName":"Elgato MCP Actions","Triggers":[],"Requirements":{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Requirements.RequirementsSetModel, MixItUp.Base","Requirements":[]},"Actions":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.ConditionalActionModel, MixItUp.Base","CaseSensitive":false,"Operator":0,"RepeatWhileTrue":false,"Clauses":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.ConditionalClauseModel, MixItUp.Base","ComparisionType":1,"Value1":"1","Value2":"1","Value3":""}],"CommandID":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","Actions":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.ScriptActionModel, MixItUp.Base","ActionType":0,"Script":"using System;\r\n\r\nnamespace CustomNamespace\r\n{\r\n    public class CustomClass\r\n    {\r\n/*\r\n*\r\n*\t Trigger MCP Actions in Stream Deck with Mix It Up\r\n*\t (Elgato MCP Controller.miucommand)\r\n*\r\n*    Full instructions here:\r\n*\r\n*    https://github.com/dralezero/mcp-actions-for-mixitup/blob/main/README.md\r\n*\r\n*    QUICK SETUP:\r\n*\t  \r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*     Stream Deck 7.4.0 or higher\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*     Settings > General > Enable MCP Actions\r\n*     Create buttons in MCP Actions profile with unique titles.\r\n*     No special characters.\r\n*    \r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*     Install Node.js and Elgato MCP Server\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*     \r\n*     1. Run \"Create installer script\" (the action below this one you're reading)\r\n*     2. Close Mix It Up\r\n*     3. Check your Desktop for install-nodejs-elgatomcp.bat\r\n*     4. right-click install-nodejs-elgatomcp.bat, Run as administrator\r\n*     5. Delete file (install-nodejs-elgatomcp.bat). No longer needed.\r\n*     \r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*     Create commands in Mix It Up\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*     \r\n*     Command Type: Action Group\r\n*     Command: Elgato MCP Controller\r\n*     \t\t(this action group you're looking at now)\r\n*     Command arguments:\r\n*     \r\n*     elgatostartmcp\r\n*     \t(A minimized cmd window will open. Keep open to trigger MCP Actions)\r\n*     \t(Add to Events > Generic > Application Launch)\r\n*     \t\r\n*     elgatostopmcp\r\n*     \t(Add to Events > Generic > Application Exit)\r\n*     \r\n*     MCP Action Title\t    \r\n*     \t(copy/paste title from Stream Deck MCP Actions button)\r\n*\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*\t  Notice:\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*\t  Files are automatically created on your computer to assist\r\n*\t  the functionality of this Elgato MCP Controller\r\n*\t  Created here by default: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\MixItUpElgatoMCP\r\n*\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*\t  Disclaimer\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*\t  This is an unofficial community project. \r\n*\t  DraleZero is not affiliated with Mix It Up or Elgato or any of their products. \r\n*\t  All product names, logos, and brands are property of their respective owners.\r\n*\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*\t  Created by DraleZero (MIT License)\r\n*\t  Built with and for use in Mix It Up (MIT License) \r\n*\t  C# and Batch scripts by DraleZero (MIT License) assisted with Claude\r\n*\t  ==================================================================\r\n*\r\n*\t  MIT License\r\n*\r\n*\t  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\r\n*\t  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\r\n*\t  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\r\n*\t  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\r\n*\t  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\r\n*\t  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\r\n*\r\n*\t  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\r\n*\t  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\r\n*\r\n*\t  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\r\n*\t  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\r\n*\t  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\r\n*\t  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\r\n*\t  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\r\n*\t  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\r\n*\t  SOFTWARE.\r\n*\r\n*/\r\n        public object Run()\r\n        {\r\n            try\r\n            {\r\n                return null;\r\n            }\r\n            catch\r\n            {\r\n                return null;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}","ID":"806ed776-0063-4106-af27-188be5a2e5da","Name":"READ ME","Type":38,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.ScriptActionModel, MixItUp.Base","ActionType":0,"Script":"using System;\r\nusing System.IO;\r\n//made by DraleZero using Claude\r\nnamespace CustomNamespace\r\n{\r\n    public class CustomClass\r\n    {\r\n        public object Run()\r\n        {   \r\n            string batPath = string.Empty;\r\n\t\t\tstring dirPath = string.Empty;\r\n            try\r\n            {\r\n            \r\n            \tdirPath = Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.Desktop);\r\n\t\t\t    batPath = Path.Combine(dirPath, \"install-nodejs-elgatomcp.bat\");\r\n            \r\n                if (!File.Exists(batPath))\r\n                {\r\n                    File.WriteAllLines(batPath, new string[]\r\n\t\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"@echo off\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Elgato MCP Server Setup\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo This script will download and install:\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo   - Node.js\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo   - Elgato MCP Server\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"set /p confirm=\\\"Do you want to continue? (Y/N): \\\"\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"if /i not \\\"%confirm%\\\"==\\\"Y\\\" (\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo Installation cancelled.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"pause\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"exit /b\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\")\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Downloading Node.js...\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"curl -L -o \\\"%TEMP%\\\\nodejsinstaller.msi\\\" \\\"https://nodejs.org/dist/v24.16.0/node-v24.16.0-x64.msi\\\"\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Installing Node.js...\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"msiexec /i \\\"%TEMP%\\\\nodejsinstaller.msi\\\" /qn /norestart\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Waiting for installation to complete...\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"timeout /t 10 /nobreak\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Refreshing PATH...\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \\\"$env:PATH = [System.Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable('PATH','Machine') + ';' + [System.Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable('PATH','User'); Write-Host 'PATH refreshed successfully'\\\"\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Installing Elgato MCP Server...\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \\\"$env:PATH = [System.Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable('PATH','Machine') + ';' + [System.Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable('PATH','User'); npm install -g @elgato/mcp-server\\\"\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo.\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo  Setup Complete!\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"echo ================================\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"pause\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t});\r\n                    \r\n                    string message = batPath.Replace(dirPath, \"\");\r\n                \r\n                    //return \"Bat file created: \" + message;\r\n                    return null;\r\n                }\r\n                else\r\n                {\r\n                \r\n                \tstring message = batPath.Replace(dirPath, \"\");\r\n                \r\n                    //return \"Bat file already exists: \" + message;\r\n                    return null;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            catch (UnauthorizedAccessException ex)\r\n            {\r\n            \tstring message = ex.Message.Replace(dirPath, \"\");\r\n                \r\n                return \"ERROR: Permission denied: \" + ex.Message;\r\n            }\r\n            catch (DirectoryNotFoundException ex)\r\n            {\r\n            \tstring message = ex.Message.Replace(dirPath, \"\");\r\n                \r\n                return \"ERROR: Directory not found: \" + ex.Message;\r\n            }\r\n            catch (Exception ex)\r\n            {\r\n            \tstring message = ex.Message.Replace(dirPath, \"\");\r\n                \r\n                return \"ERROR: Unexpected error: \" + ex.Message;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}","ID":"0f00f033-a1ed-484e-bea0-4171f46db343","Name":"Create installer script","Type":38,"Enabled":true}],"ID":"4ba2ced4-88d3-433a-b6f4-c2b714c6a763","Name":"INSTALL (keep this disabled)","Type":17,"Enabled":false},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.GroupActionModel, MixItUp.Base","Actions":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.SpecialIdentifierActionModel, MixItUp.Base","SpecialIdentifierName":"elgatomcpmiubasepath","ReplacementText":"%LOCALAPPDATA%","MakeGloballyUsable":true,"ShouldProcessMath":false,"ReplaceSpecialIdentifiersInFunctions":false,"ID":"e6146b39-88b9-4e2b-9f53-a6274f0dfc8d","Name":"CONFIG: Folder Path","Type":12,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.SpecialIdentifierActionModel, MixItUp.Base","SpecialIdentifierName":"elgatomcpurl","ReplacementText":"localhost:9090","MakeGloballyUsable":true,"ShouldProcessMath":false,"ReplaceSpecialIdentifiersInFunctions":false,"ID":"04566082-c5e4-4285-80b1-51255caac05b","Name":"CONFIG: MCP URL","Type":12,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.SpecialIdentifierActionModel, MixItUp.Base","SpecialIdentifierName":"elgatomcperrorschat","ReplacementText":"on","MakeGloballyUsable":false,"ShouldProcessMath":false,"ReplaceSpecialIdentifiersInFunctions":false,"ID":"c03dbe5c-0347-4014-9565-10f3cc45f446","Name":"CONFIG: Errors/Alerts in chat: ON/OFF","Type":12,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.SpecialIdentifierActionModel, MixItUp.Base","SpecialIdentifierName":"elgatomcpdebug","ReplacementText":"off","MakeGloballyUsable":false,"ShouldProcessMath":false,"ReplaceSpecialIdentifiersInFunctions":false,"ID":"345479f0-354e-4cb8-bf32-87a16fbf9df7","Name":"CONFIG: Debug file: ON/OFF","Type":12,"Enabled":true}],"ID":"c1045651-0d18-40e3-85c9-0fb25c340832","Name":"CONFIGURATION","Type":39,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.GroupActionModel, MixItUp.Base","Actions":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.GroupActionModel, MixItUp.Base","Actions":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.ScriptActionModel, MixItUp.Base","ActionType":0,"Script":"using System;\r\nusing System.IO;\r\n            \r\nnamespace CustomNamespace\r\n{\r\n    public class CustomClass\r\n    {\r\n        public object Run()\r\n        {\r\n            try{\r\n            \r\n            string elgatomcpmiufolderpath = @\"$elgatomcpmiubasepath\"; // MixItUp variable\r\n\r\n\t\t\tstring batPath;\r\n\t\t\tstring dirPath;\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\tif (string.IsNullOrEmpty(elgatomcpmiufolderpath) \r\n    \t\t|| elgatomcpmiufolderpath.Equals(\"%LOCALAPPDATA%\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t    string appData = Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.LocalApplicationData);\r\n\t\t\t    dirPath = Path.Combine(appData, \"MixItUpElgatoMCP\");\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t    if (!Directory.Exists(dirPath))\r\n\t\t\t    {\r\n\t\t\t        Directory.CreateDirectory(dirPath);\r\n\t\t\t    }\r\n\t\t\t}else\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t    dirPath = Path.Combine(elgatomcpmiufolderpath, \"MixItUpElgatoMCP\");\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t    if (!Directory.Exists(dirPath))\r\n\t\t\t    {\r\n\t\t\t        Directory.CreateDirectory(dirPath);\r\n\t\t\t    }\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\treturn dirPath;\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t}catch{\r\n\t\t\t\treturn null;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}","ID":"95049a9c-a72a-457d-aeb2-a928b1cc84ef","Name":"Build folder path","Type":38,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.SpecialIdentifierActionModel, MixItUp.Base","SpecialIdentifierName":"elgatomcpmiufolderpath","ReplacementText":"$scriptresult","MakeGloballyUsable":true,"ShouldProcessMath":false,"ReplaceSpecialIdentifiersInFunctions":false,"ID":"002e7a29-c5ef-415f-ba37-c6dcd2693915","Name":"Save folder path to Special Identifier","Type":12,"Enabled":true},{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.GroupActionModel, MixItUp.Base","Actions":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.Model.Actions.ConditionalActionModel, MixItUp.Base","CaseSensitive":false,"Operator":0,"RepeatWhileTrue":false,"Clauses":[{"$type":"MixItUp.Base.